    "summary": "Picking this unit to shoot in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) lets you pay 1 **Pain token** to make it [Empowered](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain). If [Empowered](vsdata:ability/drukhari.power-from-pain) after shooting, it marks one enemy unit hit by its attacks. **MONSTERS** and **VEHICLES** are ineligible. The mark imposes −2 **Move** and −2 on **Charge** rolls, expiring when your next turn begins.",
